### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/licencias

### 1. Activar Licencia Exitosa (Clave del seed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/activar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clave": "LIC-2026-POS-DEMO-KEY"
}

### 2. Activar Licencia Inexistente (Error 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/activar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clave": "LICENCIA-INEXISTENTE-12345"
}

### 3. Clave vacía o inválida (Error 400 - Zod)
POST {{baseUrl}}/activar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clave": ""
}
